<p>During weekly reviews, focus on recurring issues and build an internal lessons-learned list.</p>
<h2>FAQ Quick Reference</h2>
<p><strong>Q: Creative review rejected but unsure of specific reason?</strong><br />
A: Check rejection explanations in the ad backend; some platforms support appeals. For misjudgments, prepare product qualifications, brand authorization, and other supporting materials for reconsideration.</p>
<p><strong>Q: Account suddenly restricted but no notification?</strong><br />
A: Usually caused by spending spikes or abnormal landing page redirects triggering system restrictions. Recommend pausing related ads first, checking landing page functionality; systems auto-unblock after 24 hours.</p>
<p><strong>Q: How to avoid associated account bans in multi-account management?</strong><br />
A: Use different device IPs and browser environments when logging into each platform backend; avoid logging into multiple accounts on the same device or IP.</p>
